### 提示
### 先执行 `requests/auth.http` 里的登录请求，
### 然后把返回的 `access-token` 和 `refresh-token` 放到下面的变量里。

@baseUrl = http://localhost:2333
@accessToken = your_access_token
@refreshToken = your_refresh_token

### ============================================================
### Agent 管理接口
### ============================================================

### create agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/create_agent
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "agent_name": "tomorin",
  "base_url": "http://localhost:11434",
  "api_key": "1145141919810",
  "provider": "ollama",
  "model_name": "huihui_ai/qwen3.5-abliterated:4B"
}

### update agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/update_agent
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "agent_id": 1,
  "agent_name": "tomorin",
  "base_url": "http://localhost:11434",
  "api_key": "1145141919810",
  "provider": "ollama",
  "model_name": "huihui_ai/qwen3.5-abliterated:4B",
  "prompts": {},
  "memories": {},
  "activate": true
}

### list agents (canonical)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agents
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

### list agents (compat)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/list
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

### query one agent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/1
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

### ============================================================
### LLM 调用接口
### ============================================================

### invoke agent (non-stream)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoke_agent
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "agent_id": 1,
  "ai_options": {
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "thinking": false,
    "search_internet": false
  },
  "sys_prompt": "You are a helpful assistant.",
  "usr_prompt": "What is Go language?"
}

### chat (SSE stream)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "agent_id": 1,
  "ai_options": {
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "thinking": false,
    "search_internet": false
  },
  "sys_prompt": "你是一个一个一个一个",
  "usr_prompt": "德川和我修院是谁"
}

### chat (continue with chat_id)
### 先从上一个 SSE 首包 data 中取 chat_id 填入
@chatId = paste_chat_id_here
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat?chat_id={{chatId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "agent_id": 1,
  "ai_options": {
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "thinking": false,
    "search_internet": false
  },
  "sys_prompt": "You are a keyboard politician.",
  "usr_prompt": "Continue this conversation."
}

### ============================================================
### 聊天会话管理接口
### ============================================================

### list chat sessions (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chats?page=1&page_size=20
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

### get chat session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/{{chatId}}
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}
